  "AICR is a machine-readable rights declaration layer. It lets a publisher state — per site, per path, or per resource — whether AI systems may read, summarize, quote, retrieve (RAG), transform, train on, commercially use, or redistribute content, and under which conditions such as attribution, retention limits, or contact-based licensing. Where robots.txt only says \"crawl or don't\", AICR carries the semantics of rights.": "AICR se yon kouch deklarasyon dwa machin ka li. Li pèmèt yon editè deklare — pou chak sit, chak chemen, oswa chak resous — si sistèm AI gen dwa li, fè rezime, site, rekipere (RAG), transfòme, antrene sou, itilize pou rezon komèsyal, oswa redistribye kontni, ak anba ki kondisyon, tankou atribisyon, limit retansyon, oswa lisans ki mande yon kontak. Kote robots.txt sèlman di \"endekse oswa pa fè sa\", AICR pote siyifikasyon dwa yo.",
