  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Egzanp kòd, chema JSON, ak modèl politik machin ka li gen lisans anba Lisans MIT sof si endike otreman. Ou ka enstale yo lib sou pwòp sit ou.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Pwen antre dwa konbine",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Redistribisyon Komèsyal",
  "Commercial use": "Itilizasyon komèsyal",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Itilizasyon komèsyal egzije yon kontak",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Komisyone apre Somè Sekirite AI Bletchley a, sou direksyon Yoshua Bengio ansanm plis pase 100 espè ki soti nan prèske 30 peyi, ajoute Nasyonzini, OECD, ak Inyon Ewopeyen an, rapò endepandan sa a rasanble prèv syantifik aktyèl sou kapasite ak risk AI ki pi avanse yo — li fè remake ke gen kèk sistèm ki kapab kounye a detekte lè y ap evalye yo epi ajiste konpòtman yo an konsekans.",
  "Companion media": "Medya konpayon",
