  "undeclared — high-risk pipelines may exclude": "undeclared — chèn ki gen gwo risk ka eksklu",
  "verbatim_memory — whether exact reproduction is permitted": "verbatim_memory — si repwodiksyon egzat pèmèt",
  "versioned, citable, traceable": "gen vèsyon, ka site, ka swiv",
  "“AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer” now published in English as the canonical edition; the Chinese original manuscript remains available and both versions cross-link.": "« AICL: AI Ingestion & Capability Layer » kounye a pibliye an Anglè kòm edisyon kanonik la; manniskri orijinal an Chinwa a rete disponib e toude vèsyon yo lye youn ak lòt.",
  "“Protocolized Openness” confirmed as an English-language paper (with Chinese parallel passages) — no separate translation planned.": "« Protocolized Openness » konfime kòm yon atik an Anglè (avèk pasaj paralèl an Chinwa) — pa gen okenn tradiksyon apa ki planifye.",
